### Login as admin
POST http://localhost:8082/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "password"
}

> {% client.global.set("admin_token", response.body.token); %}


### Admin users
GET http://localhost:8082/api/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}


### Admin reports
GET http://localhost:8082/api/admin/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}


### Admin cannot access doctor schedule - should be 403
GET http://localhost:8082/api/doctor/schedule
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}


### Admin cannot access patient appointments - should be 403
GET http://localhost:8082/api/patient/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}


### Missing token - should be 401
GET http://localhost:8082/api/admin/users